#this is a todo/wish/feature-request/outlook list for the openEMS project
#priorities: todo (highest) --> outlook (lowest)

todo / mandatory for v0.1.0:
- more examples and lots of testing...
- improvments and testing for MPI engine

wishes:
- location dependend excitation given by a file (e.g. mode-profile simulated with comsol)
- more import filter (e.g. gerber import)

outlook:
- incorporate a static FD-solver into openEMS
- include other EM-solver (e.g. FEM, FDFD, TLM)

CUDA engine (this fork), see FDTD_CUDA/CHANGELOG_CUDA.md ("Not done")

todo:
- Steady-State Detection, Mur ABC and TFSF on the GPU
- verify the Lorentz term of the ADE, PML types other than PML_8 and --cuda-device other than 0
- Linux build, and a comparison with upstream v0.37.0 on real models

wishes:
- batched voltage/current integrals, asynchronous field copies, DFT on the GPU
- performance tuning (CUDA graphs, streams, pinned memory, kernel fusion)
- move the fork to a newer upstream version (series RLC element, TimeStepFactor)
